sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant V as Vision Agent
    participant S as Solver Agent
    participant RV as SymPy Reference Verifier
    participant G as Grader Agent
    participant R as Reviewer Agent
    participant T as Tools/SQLite

    U->>API: one photo (task + student solution)
    API->>V: original image bytes
    V-->>API: draft task statement + draft student transcript + uncertainty metadata
    API-->>U: show scan + two editable OCR fields
    U->>API: confirmed task statement + confirmed student transcript
    API->>S: confirmed task statement only
    S-->>API: independent machine solution
    API->>RV: solver spec + confirmed task statement
    RV-->>API: verified reference / SymPy correction
    API->>G: confirmed student transcript + verified reference + criteria
    G-->>API: compact single-pass grading audit
    API->>R: deterministic score + compact audit data
    R-->>API: one-pass consistency audit
    API->>T: render reference circle + save report/review
    API-->>U: score + step report + circle URL + technical JSON
